{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7ab58a9e788d6fb5281c1a3725166f4ef181d9284e98112aefe4a180443e1a2b", "ja": "（百合子の映画の衣装が届き、今日はフィッティング\n……なのだが、前の仕事が押してしまった！）", "zh": "（百合子电影的戏服送到了，今天要试装……不过，之前的工作耽搁了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1001_p", "source_sha256": "066a9022561da041e9172f5caa89724bb33d796f33fe2bad890684974a0605d4", "ja": "遅くなってごめん、百合子！", "zh": "抱歉来晚了，百合子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "2a5c75887b52ca0491ad797bc6152aeb041e48c6444c681e043bc94d9def85b2", "ja": "{$P$}さん、遅いじゃないですか～。\n私、ずーっと待ってたんですよ？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你也太慢了吧～。\n我可是等了你好～久呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d9ac0bac740b01069d77751eb00adda7a35b3eeaf4e1fa7bbed11a5f1949f4ad", "ja": "そうだよな。もう少し早く来られるはずだったんだけど\nなかなか抜けられなくて……。", "zh": "是啊，本来应该能再早点来的，可一直没能脱身……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "0e9b4382a85940ee82558e16f6727865cf5c3ce643014b5889afe13271de6eb2", "ja": "ふーん。つまり{$P$}さんは、\n私より、そのお仕事のほうが大事だったんですね～？", "zh": "嗯——也就是说，比起我，{$P$}先生更看重那份工作，是吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c2f151732f79a7b40b7da5581d4624687832296d69c64af2ec16c23b909c915c", "ja": "えっ！？　いやそんなことは……。\nというかさっきの仕事も、映画の宣伝会議で……！", "zh": "诶！？不，不是那样……。\n话说回来，刚才的工作也是电影宣传会议……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "1801bc4c8f39608d3bd3eef1f80dd6d6740dd60f283e6b849527dd1700db438f", "ja": "言い訳はダメですよ～？　{$P$}さん\nは、私のことだけ見ててくれないと……うふふふっ♪", "zh": "不许找借口哦～？{$P$}先生\n必须一直只看着我才行……呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5f1722917c1ba5bf8be926bca680ebff6c6340d6de01d8eaf0e1ab9d68cee3cd", "ja": "……えーっと、間違ってたらごめん。\nもしかしてこれは、役作りの一環か……？", "zh": "……那个，要是猜错了对不起啊。\n这难道是……在塑造角色的一环吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "4f5d5c681965b8f0e2b65c56cef8e1e70e83ffe9e806733b24e4188ad067b114", "ja": "役作り……？　それ、何のことですか？", "zh": "塑造角色……？　那是怎么一回事呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1009_p", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "ea810fb597d23bbba101ea2f09b6351560e86bfe98ebd011c796e63bc208afb2", "ja": "なんて、大正解です！　せっかく衣装を着たので、\nそれらしくしてみたんですけど……どうでしたか！？", "zh": "没想到居然完全答对了！难得穿上了这身服装，\n我就试着表现得像那么回事……感觉怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4a4765657c42bc149c7bb3b462e1dd2fbfce1fc31d57aeca532d8b7808ff9d30", "ja": "そ、そうか。よかった……いつもと雰囲気が違うから、\n本当に怒らせたのかと思ってドキドキしたよ。", "zh": "是、是吗。那就好……因为和往常的感觉不一样，我还以为真的把你惹生气了，紧张得不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "204f1fee8fa99edcb59dc60d158c54e7d35fc598c89615cf0ea3777575967420", "ja": "す、すみません！　その、ヤンデレっぽくしようと\n思っただけで、全然怒ってはないです！！", "zh": "对、对不起！我只是想演得有点病娇，并没有真的生气！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "95810181b3b9aeb40da3e139ac50edaf314854345a3e84283180a117f1fcb283", "ja": "私が演じる『星羅』のイメージどおりの衣装だったので\nちょっとテンションが上がっちゃって……。", "zh": "因为这套服装和我饰演的『星罗』形象完全吻合，所以一时有点情绪高涨……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "77168e0a7651d1aabbf401d0906f31f8cb6b0b02db6ee8d7b383e7faec13910f", "ja": "{$P$}さんが来るまで、星羅なら\nどう振る舞うかなってシミュレーションしてたんです！", "zh": "在{$P$}先生来之前，我一直在模拟星罗会怎么行动呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a5dc147cfe8e6333f5db0d9b1713229706b478460c48d47313824b8af4ee807b", "ja": "いや、いい演技だったよ。衣装も相まって、\nこっちも思わず本気で焦っちゃったしな。", "zh": "演得很棒哦。再加上服装的衬托，\n连我也忍不住真的慌神了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "668ed891162739761b0356463fa4c8c1ab224cae7631563c16d0852469f25bf4", "ja": "本当ですか？　よかったぁ……。\nこれなら、役作りの方向性は間違ってないかも？", "zh": "真的吗？太好了……。\n这样看来，我塑造角色的方向也许没错？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "bbf7b42892bc2bdbbfcf905f0bbc8a2964b2629c8137415c8954bf0f962df108", "ja": "あっ、突然付き合わせてしまってごめんなさい。\nでもおかげで、なんだかいい感覚が掴めた気がします！", "zh": "啊，突然拉着您陪我，真是不好意思。\n不过多亏了您，感觉好像稍微抓到不错的感觉了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1018_p", "source_sha256": "91b1f90832874611daf12467a0314fe1b567a07f8cb6dcb026b569a02c47659d", "ja": "いや全然。\n百合子のいい演技が見られて、得したくらいだよ。", "zh": "哪里的话。\n能看到百合子那么精彩的演技，我反而觉得赚到了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1019_p", "source_sha256": "42af7fdc1b8ecc06bdc855f009ec408c6eb6baaf32e5dd810c9ab06d1132a731", "ja": "けどあのちょっと強引な感じ、宣伝にも使えそうだな。\n星羅を使ったCMとか…………ブツブツ。", "zh": "不过那种稍微强硬的感觉，说不定也能拿来宣传。\n比如用星罗拍广告什么的……（自言自语）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0434_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "4d477ec3be1c98eea2741155b29f5e739a2e9c16b57e19342becfbe50835bb6e", "ja": "あの～{$P$}さん？\nそれで、衣装のフィッティングなんですけど……。", "zh": "那个～{$P$}先生？\n然后，关于服装试穿的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
